%% alt: Adapter decision tree: a deep knowledge change with the hardware to match means a full fine-tune; otherwise, if the model fits your GPU at 16-bit use peft.adapter lora, and if it does not fit use qlora, which loads the base in 4-bit so an 8B model fits in 24 GB.
flowchart TD
    Q1{"Deep knowledge change?"}
    Q1 -->|"no — the usual case"| Q2{"Fits your GPU at 16-bit?"}
    Q1 -->|"`yes, and you
have the hardware`"| FULL["`Full fine-tune
_omit the peft section_`"]
    Q2 -->|"yes"| LORA["`peft.adapter: lora
_fastest, best quality_`"]
    Q2 -->|"no"| QLORA["`peft.adapter: qlora
_4-bit base, 8B fits in 24 GB_`"]

    style FULL fill:#78350f,color:#fff
    style LORA fill:#14532d,color:#fff
    style QLORA fill:#1e3a5f,color:#fff
